# Allowlist: ignore everything, then add back only what the image needs.
# This keeps .env, .git, node_modules, the React app, local databases and
# virtualenvs out of the build context (and out of the image) by default.
*
!app/
!migrations/
!wsgi.py
!gunicorn.conf.py
!requirements.txt
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!docker/healthcheck.py

# Never ship caches or local databases, even inside the folders above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
